                                                "example_id": "73005674-b971-420a-a05a-fb22ab1f7cdf",
                                                "sense_id": "9a89220b-3d36-3ce8-8fb9-fa6bae2cc267",
                                                "text": "Anne and Leslie had another cry the next week when they shortened Little Jem. Anne felt the tragedy of it until evening when in his long nightie she found her own dear baby again."
                                            },
