                                                "example_id": "fd5cbbe5-d9e9-4189-b4ad-73db68d56cf6",
                                                "sense_id": "9a89220b-3d36-3ce8-8fb9-fa6bae2cc267",
                                                "text": "In January Jims was five months old and Rilla celebrated the anniversary by shortening him."
